    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Richfield, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1978; photo inspected in 1983; last revised in 1981; printed in 1990.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
